sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Fuzzer::ExecuteCallback
    participant G as CurrentUnitData<br/>(global)
    participant T as the target
    participant S as ASan / signal
    participant H as CrashCallback<br/>or DeathCallback
    participant F as the filesystem
    L->>G: memcpy(CurrentUnitData, Data, Size), then set CurrentUnitSize
    L->>T: CBRes = CB(DataCopy, Size)
    T->>S: out-of-bounds write hits a redzone
    S->>S: __sanitizer_acquire_crash_state() — first reporter wins
    S->>H: death callback / SIGSEGV handler
    H->>G: read CurrentUnitData, CurrentUnitSize
    H->>F: WriteUnitToFileWithPrefix(..., "crash-")
    H->>F: print "MS: ..." mutation sequence + hex + ASCII
    H->>H: PrintFinalStats() and _Exit(77)
    Note over L,F: the normal path never reaches H — it clears CurrentUnitSize and returns
